sections.usage:
```
Format this Chinese research paper using a LaTeX template. The paper is titled '[TITLE]' and authored by '[AUTHOR]'. The abstract is '[ABSTRACT]'. The main sections are: [SECTIONS]. Use the '[TEMPLATE_NAME]' template and ensure all Chinese characters are properly encoded. Include a bibliography section with these references: [REFERENCES].
```
Copy

```
Here is the formatted LaTeX document for your Chinese research paper:

\documentclass[12pt]{article}
\usepackage[UTF8]{ctex}
\usepackage{amsmath}
\usepackage{graphicx}
\title{影响气候变化的经济因素分析}
\author{李明}
\date{\today}

\begin{document}

\maketitle

\begin{abstract}
本研究旨在探讨经济增长与气候变化之间的关系，通过分析中国过去三十年的数据，发现工业化进程对温室气体排放的显著影响。\end{abstract}

\section{引言}
气候变化已成为全球关注的重大问题...
```

